      "notes": [
        {
          "body": "The passage talks about professional musicians and bands. It says nothing about amateurs. So we can't infer anything about amateur numbers — the data isn't there.",
          "id": "4d2ef961-6c3c-494a-832f-6e272da5d84c",
          "letter": "A",
          "md5": "597f6bec9daa382fe4be91a4e95e720e"
        },
        {
          "body": "The passage doesn't tell us anything about individual musicians' versatility — what kinds of instruments they can play. So we can't support a claim about most musicians being able to play both electric and nonelectric instruments.",
          "id": "e8ac533b-8fc2-4f34-9819-4e9b98910967",
          "letter": "B",
          "md5": "a5c77ee66fca9e3d72da26934eb7da2d"
        },
        {
          "body": "This says some bands have grown. The stimulus tells us the average size shrank — it doesn't spotlight bands that grew. While \"average shrank\" is technically compatible with some bands growing, the passage doesn't affirmatively support that claim. The conclusion isn't there.",
          "id": "df2531ca-c644-4a96-aab6-5719facd5b68",
          "letter": "C",
          "md5": "3a98a3b237e72c3fee72359fac1e19a2"
        },
        {
          "body": "This is the math. The stimulus tells us total musicians went up and per-band musicians went down. Run that through: a bigger pool divided into smaller groups gives you more groups. So the number of professional bands must have gone up. And since electrification is what's driving both of those underlying trends in the stimulus, attributing the increase in bands to electrification is fair.",
          "id": "202bab84-0fde-46d1-b0d0-b87f276e9ae6",
          "letter": "D",
          "md5": "5aede740b37c42675b51e0ad2b0226df"
        },
        {
          "body": "This is about musicians playing in more than one band. The stimulus doesn't bring this up at all. The given facts don't support the claim either way.",
          "id": "40db1c45-09ea-42f0-8f02-26349b372608",
          "letter": "E",
          "md5": "036bf07e3687a06ac5e524b33ae8f911"
        }
      ],
