        },
        {
          "body": "This asks about wild rat populations. The study is a lab experiment. Even if we knew that 0% or 100% of wild rats eat high-salt diets, that would not tell us anything about whether these specific lab rats had high blood pressure when the study started.",
          "id": "b8db5a58-354e-4710-96c6-95dc55010e47",
