      "notes": [
        {
          "body": "This just says the kids who practiced more got more automatic at writing. The argument is not about practice — it is about whether automatic handwriting frees up the brain for composition. This answer does not bring composition into the picture at all.",
          "id": "2c3a8381-e56b-4564-9772-f33e15b24a3e",
