          "md5": "e9961055cde3ae345ad9e39b461750b3"
        },
        {
          "body": "This answer is about kids who started the lessons with automatic handwriting already. The argument is about kids whose handwriting *became* automatic during the lessons. Pre-existing automaticity is a different claim from gains in automaticity.",
          "id": "e9f76149-0d3d-4d21-93de-15962da9bce9",
          "letter": "B",
          "md5": "c796e0d956a4192b886669eeb2a8652d"
