          "body": "Map this one out: discoverer → examined all solutions. Fran is not a discoverer (denying antecedent). Conclusion: Fran has not explored all solutions (denying consequent). This is a different mistake from the original. The original moves from observed effect to assumed cause; this one moves from \"no cause\" to \"no effect.\" Wrong shape.",
